      "type": "process",
      "size": "large"
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluator",
      "label": "weighted_alpaca_eval_gpt4_turbo\n仅在送审前随机交换 A/B\n单 token 评审 • token logprob",
      "type": "process",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "restore_direction",
      "label": "恢复候选/基线方向\n仅在解析后执行\n若已交换：偏好值 ← 3 − 偏好值\n撤销 `output_1` / `output_2` 列交换",
      "type": "process",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "preferences",
      "label": "已恢复方向的成对偏好\n基线 = `output_1`\n候选 = `output_2`\n候选获胜概率 = 偏好值 − 1",
      "type": "database",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw_weighted",
      "label": "加权胜率\n均值：偏好值 − 1\n候选获胜语义 • 汇总 805 条指令",
      "type": "terminal",
      "size": "large"
    },
    {
      "id": "glm",
      "label": "反对称 GLM\n模型身份 + 输出长度\n指令难度",
      "type": "process",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper_l2",
      "label": "论文 v2 统计规范\n五折交叉验证 • L2 正则化\n来源：arXiv:2404.04475v2",
      "type": "document",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "official_l1",
      "label": "官方 0.6.6 @ cd543a149df89434\n五折交叉验证 • L1 • liblinear\n固定版本 glm_winrate.py 实现",
      "type": "document",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc_counterfactual",
      "label": "长度控制反事实\n将长度项置零\n保留模型与指令项",
      "type": "process",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "semantics",
      "label": "候选获胜语义\n自比结果 = 50%\n恢复方向后保持交换对称",
